{'symbol': 'FE', 'date': '2023-03-21 14:09:00', 'title': 'FIRSTENERGY NAMED TOP 50 DIVERSITY EMPLOYER BY MINORITY ENGINEER™ MAGAZINE', 'text': "RANKING REFLECTS COMPANY'S REPUTATION AMONG MAGAZINE'S READERS AKRON, OHIO , MARCH 21, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- FOR THE FIRST TIME IN COMPANY HISTORY, FIRSTENERGY CORP. (NYSE: FE) HAS BEEN DESIGNATED AS A TOP 50 DIVERSITY EMPLOYER BY MINORITY ENGINEER™\xa0MAGAZINE. THE RANKINGS ARE DETERMINED BASED ON A SURVEY OF RANDOMLY SELECTED MINORITY ENGINEER READERS WHO WERE ASKED TO NAME THE EMPLOYERS WHERE THEY WOULD MOST LIKE TO WORK OR THAT THEY BELIEVE PROVIDE A POSITIVE WORKING ENVIRONMENT FOR MEMBERS OF MINORITY GROUPS."}